        "id": 144623,
        "name": "Natediggadoggity",
        "username": "Natediggadoggity",
        "avatar_template": "/letter_avatar_proxy/v4/letter/n/f04885/{size}.png",
        "created_at": "2015-07-10T20:46:36.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>Maybe I'm unique in that I don't like his sound effects, I have to turn them off. While the voice in perform isn't a bad voice, it isn't the trained operatic voice I imagine him to have. And the bell... doesn't sound like a bell anyone could play a harmony with. Some of the sounds I can almost imagine are the beginning of one of his epic songs that inspires the heroes, but the bell and his voice just completely fall flat for me.</p>",
